<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>내 수강과목 | 학사관리시스템</title>

    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet"
          href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet"
          href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" />

    <style>
        /* ============================================
           RESET + GLOBAL
        ============================================ */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Pretendard', 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background-color: #F5F7FA;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ============================================
           MAIN CARD — 전체 박스를 하나로 감싸기
        ============================================ */
        .main-card {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 35px 32px;
            border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 22px rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.12);
        }

        /* ============================================
           COURSE CARD
        ============================================ */
        .course-card {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 22px 24px;
            border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.12);
            transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .course-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.20);
        }

        /* 상태 뱃지 */
        .status-badge {
            background: #ECFDF5;
            color: #047857;
            font-size: 11px;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* 시간 chip */
        .class-time-chip {
            background: #EEF6FF;
            color: #1D4ED8;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        /* empty box */
        .empty-box {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 2px dashed #D1D5DB;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #6B7280;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: #2563EB;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background .25s ease, transform .25s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #1D4ED8;
            transform: scale(1.04);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="text-gray-800">

{{> studentLayout/studentPageHeader }}

<main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">

    <!-- ⭐⭐⭐ 전체를 감싸는 메인 카드 ⭐⭐⭐ -->
    <div class="main-card">

        <!-- 제목 영역 -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
            <div>
                <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bookmark text-blue-600"></i>
                    내 수강과목
                </h1>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
                    현재 학기에 수강 중인 강의 목록입니다. 카드를 클릭하면 각 강의의 홈 화면으로 이동합니다.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 수강과목 카드 리스트 -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">

            {{#courseList}}
            <article class="course-card"
                     onclick="location.href='/studentCourseHome?courseNo={{courseNo}}'">

                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-blue-600 mb-1">
                            {{deptName}}
                        </p>

                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-snug">
                            {{courseName}}
                        </h2>

                        <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-xs text-gray-600">
                            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie w-4"></i>
                                {{professorName}} 교수님
                            </span>
                            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-star w-4"></i>
                                {{courseScore}} 학점
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <span class="status-badge">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-[10px] mr-1"></i>
                        수강중
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-5">
                    <div class="class-time-chip">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-days w-4"></i>
                        {{yoilName}}요일 · {{courseTimeStart}}교시 ~ {{courseTimeEnd}}교시
                    </div>
                </div>

            </article>
            {{/courseList}}

            {{^courseList}}
            <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
                <div class="empty-box">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-circle-question text-4xl text-gray-400 mb-3"></i>
                    <p class="text-sm mb-2">현재 수강 중인 과목이 없습니다.</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4">
                        수강신청 기간이라면 아래 버튼을 눌러 강의를 신청해 보세요.
                    </p>

                    <a href="/courseListForEnrollment" class="btn-primary">
                        수강신청 하러 가기
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-xs"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            {{/courseList}}

        </section>

    </div>
    <!-- ⭐⭐⭐ 메인 카드 끝 ⭐⭐⭐ -->

</main>

{{> studentLayout/studentFooter }}

</body>
</html>
